Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 07:35:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/41] feat: optional gzip compression for binary RPC
 responses

Server compresses response only when client sends Accept-Encoding: gzip.
Standard wallets without gzip support get uncompressed responses (compatible).
Uses flate2 GzEncoder with fast compression. Skips compression for small responses (<1KB).
